      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-group",
      "description": "The Group hero action: uppercase Inter, 2px corners and white text on the darker violet fill.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-group-button\" href=\"#ecosystem\">Explore the divisions<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
