      "refersTo": "editorial-link-group",
      "description": "Compact uppercase exploration link with a hover underline; the source uses lighter violet for text.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-editorial-link\" href=\"/studio\">Explore Studio<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-editorial-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:fit-content;min-height:44px;color:#a995ff;font-family:\"Inter\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:transparent;text-underline-offset:5px;transition:text-decoration-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-editorial-link svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none}.ds-editorial-link:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}.ds-editorial-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#7b5cff);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #050505}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-editorial-link{transition-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Desktop Section Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-link-group",
      "description": "The actual Group section labels, 44px targets, and accent underline on hover; no invented active tab.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><a href=\"#ecosystem\">Ecosystem</a><a href=\"#current-project\">Current project</a><a href=\"#roadmap\">Roadmap</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-desktop-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:38px;background:#080808}.ds-desktop-nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:#c6c6cf;font-family:\"Inter\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:17px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:5px;white-space:nowrap;transition:color 160ms ease-out}.ds-desktop-nav a:hover{color:#a995ff;text-decoration:underline}.ds-desktop-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#7b5cff);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #050505}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-desktop-nav a{transition-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Native Mobile Disclosure",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "The shipped details/summary interaction in a local masthead-sized preview. Source switches to it below 1100px; Escape/link/desktop-resize closing is a React enhancement.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-mobile-header\"><details class=\"ds-mobile-menu\"><summary aria-label=\"Navigation menu\"><svg class=\"ds-menu-open\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"/></svg><svg class=\"ds-menu-close\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"/></svg></summary><nav class=\"ds-mobile-navigation\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#games\">Games<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#beyond-90\">Beyond 90<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#volleyball-rally\">Volleyball Rally<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#partners\">Partners<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#community\">Follow<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a href=\"mailto:mosesonerhime11@gmail.com\">Contact Drixil<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></nav></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-mobile-header{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:64px;padding-inline:20px;color:var(--publisher-text,#f7f7f7);background:#080808;font-family:\"Merriweather Sans\",sans-serif}.ds-mobile-menu summary{display:grid;width:44px;height:44px;place-items:center;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.ds-mobile-menu summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-mobile-menu summary svg{width:24px;height:24px}.ds-mobile-menu summary:hover{border-color:#fff}.ds-mobile-menu summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff);outline-offset:3px}.ds-menu-close,.ds-mobile-menu[open] .ds-menu-open{display:none}.ds-mobile-menu[open] .ds-menu-close{display:block}.ds-mobile-navigation{position:absolute;top:64px;right:0;left:0;max-height:calc(100svh - 65px);overflow-y:auto;border-bottom:1px solid #555;padding:16px 24px;background:#111;box-shadow:0 18px 28px #0006}.ds-mobile-navigation a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:52px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--publisher-rule,#2b2b2d);color:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.ds-mobile-navigation a svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-mobile-navigation a:hover{color:var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff)}.ds-mobile-navigation a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #050505}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Development Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "development-status",
      "description": "Noninteractive written status plus a dot, shown in both actual Interactive variants. It is not a pill or filter.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-status-examples\"><p class=\"ds-status\">Currently working on</p><p class=\"ds-status ds-status-blue\">In development</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-status-examples{display:grid;gap:16px}.ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0;color:var(--publisher-muted,#c0c0c4);font-family:\"Merriweather Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-status::before{flex:none;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff);content:\"\"}.ds-status-blue::before{background:#66baff}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-status{font-size:10px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Division Directory Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "division-card",
      "description": "The Group directory entry: Inter text, subdued route-tinted metallic backdrop, truthful status, and hover-only fill/border change. The raster backdrop is documented in DESIGN.md; this isolated snippet shows its controls and type.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-division-entry\" href=\"/labs\"><div><h3>Drixil Labs</h3><p>AI, software, SaaS, automation, and internal tools.</p><span>Website in development</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-division-entry{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--publisher-rule,#2b2b2d);border-radius:6px;padding:22px;background:#080808;color:var(--publisher-text,#f7f7f7);font-family:\"Inter\",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color 160ms ease-out,background-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-division-entry h3{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance}.ds-division-entry p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--publisher-muted,#c0c0c4);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.ds-division-entry span{display:block;margin-top:14px;color:#aaaab2;font-size:11px}.ds-division-entry svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none}.ds-division-entry:hover{border-color:#8a72e8;background:#18131f}.ds-division-entry:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#7b5cff);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #050505}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-division-entry{padding:20px}.ds-division-entry h3{font-size:16px}}@media(max-width:479px){.ds-division-entry{min-height:120px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-division-entry{transition-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Community Destination Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "community-row",
      "description": "The implemented large ruled destination pattern, keeping platform name and explanatory copy together.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-community-row\" href=\"https://discord.gg/63ZZBdW8p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg><span><strong>Beyond 90 Discord</strong><span>Talk with the Beyond 90 community</span></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-community-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;min-height:94px;border-top:1px solid var(--publisher-rule,#2b2b2d);padding-block:18px;color:var(--publisher-text,#f7f7f7);font-family:\"Merriweather Sans\",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:color 160ms ease-out}.ds-community-row>span{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-community-row>svg{width:22px;height:22px;flex:none}.ds-community-row>svg:last-child{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-community-row strong{display:block;font-size:18px}.ds-community-row span span{display:block;margin-top:6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--publisher-muted,#c0c0c4)}.ds-community-row:hover{color:var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff)}.ds-community-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--publisher-accent,#3896ff);outline-offset:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #050505}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-community-row{transition-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-duration:0.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Drixil Publisher System",
    "overview": "Drixil's publisher system pairs dark, flat surfaces with bold type and the supplied company marks. The Group identity uses violet; Interactive uses Beyond 90 blue. Original game artwork and authorized blue variants carry the richest colour, while the surrounding interface stays legible and direct.\n\nThe system connects the parent company, its divisions, and game discovery without treating them as the same page. Large headings establish hierarchy, compact labels explain context, and visible development status keeps the presentation honest. Page-specific composition belongs in .impeccable/surfaces/src-app-tsx.md; this document records the shared visual language implemented in the source.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Black and charcoal surfaces, off-white headings, and readable muted copy.",
      "Violet Group actions and blue Interactive actions with separate text-safe treatments.",
      "Local Inter for Group; local Merriweather Sans and uppercase Mitr for Interactive.",
      "Integrated silver/violet brand atmosphere behind live Group copy, with readable mobile translation.",
      "Crisp controls, softly rounded artwork, and restrained hover feedback.",
      "Native disclosure navigation, visible keyboard focus, and mobile reading-order continuity."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Accent Contrast",
        "body": "Group text accents use group-text, while white-on-violet filled actions use group-action. Do not substitute the focus/status violet for either role.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Division Type",
        "body": "Use Inter throughout Group-themed surfaces. Use Merriweather Sans for Interactive's body, labels, and controls, with Mitr reserved for its implemented uppercase display roles, not paragraphs.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "Flat Surface",
        "body": "Separate content with ground/panel tone changes, spacing, and rules. The mobile navigation shadow is an overlay treatment, not a card-elevation system.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the supplied Drixil marks, original project artwork, and confirmed partner assets; retain provenance for authorized generated atmosphere and blue variants.",
      "Do keep Group's text-safe violet and white-on-violet action fill in their documented roles.",
      "Do use the filled game action and outline community action as distinct destinations.",
      "Do retain visible focus, native disclosure semantics, descriptive link names, and written development status.",
      "Do stack content and actions in reading order at the implemented breakpoints, keeping essential content available without JavaScript.",
      "Do use the existing local fonts and respect reduced-motion preferences."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace Drixil identity with another publisher's branding or present generated atmosphere and promotional artwork as factual projects or shipped gameplay.",
      "Don't infer a release date, shipped game, client portfolio, review, award, or metric from promotional artwork.",
      "Don't add pill-shaped controls or diffuse card shadows as if they were established patterns.",
      "Don't turn noninteractive status labels or game-mode text into controls without a product requirement.",
      "Don't invent input, disabled, error, or light-theme variants; none are part of this implemented system.",
      "Don't make either homepage's exact hero composition a global restriction on future surfaces."
    ]
  }
}
